{"title": "Avatar of BOOOAL (Condition)", "pageid": 6214, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Avatar of BOOOAL Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Avatar_of_BOOOAL_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Avatar of BOOOAL</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The sight of a kuo-toa servant dying fills BOOOAL with bloodlust. It regains <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> when it kills a creature and can attack three times. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_AVATAROFBOOOAL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_AVATAROFBOOOAL+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_AVATAROFBOOOAL+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Avatar_of_BOOOAL\">Creatures with Avatar of BOOOAL</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/30px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/45px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/60px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88